        "content": "## Automated Brazil IBGE CNAE 2.3 & Municipal Code B2B Tax Enricher Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nEnriches Brazilian CNAE 2.3 industry codes via official IBGE CONCLA APIs. Extracts permitted activities, tax exclusions, hierarchy (Section/Division/Class), and official 7-digit IBGE municipal codes for NF-e/NFS-e compliance.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-ibge-cnae-municipal-b2b-expansion-enricher](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-ibge-cnae-municipal-b2b-expansion-enricher)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-ibge-cnae-municipal-b2b-expansion-enricher** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
